# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Tree Gnome Village" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Tree Gnome King
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	line	King Bolren	Well hello stranger. My name's Bolren, I'm the king of the tree gnomes.
1	line	King Bolren	I'm surprised you made it in, maybe I made the maze too easy.
1	line	Player	Maybe.
1	line	King Bolren	I'm afraid I have more serious concerns at the moment. Very serious.
1	option	Can I help at all?
2	line	Player	Can I help at all?
2	line	King Bolren	I'm glad you asked.
2	line	King Bolren	The truth is my people are in grave danger. We have always been protected by the Spirit Tree. No creature of dark can harm us while its three orbs are in place.
2	line	King Bolren	We are not a violent race, but we fight when we must. Many gnomes have fallen battling the dark forces of Khazard to the North.
2	line	King Bolren	We became desperate, so we took one orb of protection to the battlefield. It was a foolish move.
2	line	King Bolren	Khazard troops seized the orb. Now we are completely defenceless.
2	line	Player	How can I help?
2	line	King Bolren	You would be a huge benefit on the battlefield. If you would go there and try to retrieve the orb, my people and I will be forever grateful.
2	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 45.
2	select	Start the Tree Gnome Village quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	I would be glad to help.
3	line	King Bolren	Thank you. The battlefield is to the north of the maze. Commander Montai will inform you of their current situation.
3	line	King Bolren	That is if he's still alive.
3	line	King Bolren	My assistant shall guide you out. Good luck friend, try your best to return the orb
3	box	Elkoy guides you out of the maze.
3	line	Elkoy	We're out of the maze now. Please hurry, we must have the orb if we are to survive.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	I'm sorry but I won't be involved.
3	line	King Bolren	Ok then, travel safe.
3	action	end
1	option	I'll leave you to it then.
2	line	Player	I'll leave you to it then.
2	line	King Bolren	Ok, take care.
2	action	end
