0	section	Commander Montai
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	line	Commander Montai	Hello traveller, are you here to help or just to watch?
1	line	Player	I've been sent by King Bolren to retrieve the orb of protection.
1	line	Commander Montai	Excellent we need all the help we can get.
1	line	Commander Montai	I'm commander Montai. The orb is in the Khazard stronghold to the north, but until we weaken their defences we can't get close.
1	line	Player	What can I do?
1	line	Commander Montai	Firstly we need to strengthen our own defences. We desperately need wood to make more battlements, once the battlements are gone it's all over. Six loads of normal logs should do it.
1	option	Sorry, I no longer want to be involved.
2	line	Player	Sorry I no longer want to be involved.
2	line	Commander Montai	That's a shame, we could have done with your help.
2	action	end
1	option	Ok, I'll gather some wood.
2	line	Player	Ok, I'll gather some wood.
2	line	Commander Montai	Please be as quick as you can, I don't know how much longer we can hold out.
2	action	end
