2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Commander Montai afterwards
1	line	Player	How are you doing Montai?
1	line	Commander Montai	We're hanging in there soldier. For the next phase of our attack we need to breach their stronghold.
1	line	Commander Montai	The ballista can break through the stronghold wall, and then we can advance and seize back the orb.
1	line	Player	So what's the problem?
1	line	Commander Montai	From this distance we can't get an accurate enough shot. We need the correct coordinates of the stronghold for a direct hit. I've sent out three tracker gnomes to gather them.
1	line	Player	Have they returned?
1	line	Commander Montai	I'm afraid not, and we're running out of time. I need you to go into the heart of the battlefield, find the trackers, and bring back the coordinates.
1	line	Commander Montai	Do you think you can do it?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	No, I've had enough of your battle.
2	line	Player	No, I've had enough of your battle.
2	line	Commander Montai	I understand, this isn't your fight.
2	action	end
1	option	I'll try my best.
2	line	Player	I'll try my best.
2	line	Commander Montai	Thank you, you're braver than most.
2	line	Commander Montai	I don't know how long I will be able to hold out. Once you have the coordinates come back and fire the ballista right into those monsters.
2	line	Commander Montai	If you can retrieve the orb and bring safety back to my people, none of the blood spilled on this field will be in vain.
2	action	end
